": {"id": 8, "region": "worldwide"}}, {"id": 910506, "date": 1778544000, "platform": 14, "y": 2026, "release_region": {"id": 8, "region": "worldwide"}}], "screenshots": [{"id": 1832724, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc13a50.jpg"}, {"id": 1832725, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc13a51.jpg"}, {"id": 1832726, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc13a52.jpg"}], "slug": "breath-bound", "storyline": "The way up is harder than the way down.\n\nYou both start at the bottom of the sea, slow and careful, sharing a single tank of air.\n\nBubbles are scarce, currents tug, and every movement must be timed together as you rise toward the surface. Try it solo to manage both divers at once, or tackle the climb with a partner. The ascent is brief but tense, and every exchange matters.", "summary": "Breath Bound is a 2D co-op puzzle adventure where two divers share one oxygen tank and have to keep each other alive by scrounging air and navigating the treacherous obstacles of the sea. Every stretch of the journey back to the surface is a small test of coordination, timing and teamwork.", "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/breath-bound", "videos": [{"id": 183339, "name": "Announcement Trailer", "video_id": "omxbST7_P5g", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=omxbST7_P5g", "title": "Breath Bound Announcement Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/omxbST7_P5g/maxresdefault.jpg"}]}